        <section class="page" id="page-dialogue"><div class="eyebrow">Real-world role-play · Kathmandu</div><h1>At the bank</h1><p class="sub">Verify a payment and ask for a receipt with confidence.</p><div class="panel dialogue"><div class="dialog-head"><div class="roundicon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="messages-square" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-messages-square"><path d="M16 10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 14.286V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><path d="M20 9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10.286a.71.71 0 0 1-1.212.502l-2.202-2.202A2 2 0 0 0 17.172 19H10a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1"></path></svg></div><div><h3>A conversation in progress</h3><p class="sub" style="margin-top:3px!important">Practise polite, natural workplace English</p></div></div><div class="chatline"><div class="avatar">BK</div><div><div class="speaker">Bank officer</div><div class="bubble">Good morning. How can I help you today?</div></div></div><div class="chatline me"><div class="avatar">AS</div><div><div class="speaker">You · choose a response</div><div class="bubble">I’d like to check whether my payment went through.</div></div></div><div class="chatline"><div class="avatar">BK</div><div><div class="speaker">Bank officer</div><div class="bubble">Of course. Do you have the transaction reference?</div></div></div><div class="dialog-controls"><button class="play"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="volume-2" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-volume-2"><path d="M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"></path><path